      "effect": "2.53x geomean director-verified vs the frozen baseline, non-overlapping (paired 2.51x agrees within 1.1%); per-case 2.48x / 2.56x / 2.55x at B=2 / 32 / 64 - nearly flat, the signature of a dispatch-bound op",
      "confirms_cited": 0,
